<%- include('partials/header') %>
<section class="wrap narrow prose">
  <h1>Help &amp; policies</h1>
  <h3 id="shipping">Shipping</h3>
  <p>We ship from Hyderabad within 24 hours on working days. Delivery takes 2–5 days to metros and up to 7 days elsewhere. Delivery is free above <%= inr(FREE_SHIPPING_FROM) %>; otherwise it's ₹49.</p>
  <h3>Cash on delivery</h3>
  <p>COD is available on orders up to ₹10,000.</p>
  <h3 id="returns">Returns &amp; replacements</h3>
  <p>If your product is defective or damaged, request a replacement within 7 days of delivery from <a href="/account">My orders</a>. Opened audio products can only be replaced, not refunded, for hygiene reasons.</p>
  <h3 id="warranty">Warranty</h3>
  <p>Branded products carry the manufacturer's warranty shown on each product page; keep your VoltKart invoice. Volt Essentials products have a 6–12 month VoltKart warranty.</p>
  <h3>Coupons</h3>
  <p><b>VOLT10</b>: 10% off up to ₹1,000 on orders above ₹2,000. <b>FIRST200</b>: ₹200 off your first order above ₹1,499. One coupon per order.</p>
</section>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
